Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,awesome treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hidden at the end of the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the courage that sail and believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we will see a glimpse of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun rising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}fedew\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.81,0:00:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.72,0:00:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sailed toward different dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.27,0:00:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.91,0:00:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for together we found we looked\Nthrough the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Gab\NGalaxy 9000\NGol D. Rocks\NPepperjack\NWestfal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the compass points, our destiny.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back.\NTake the hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, we can't\Nstop all our troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab\NVillager
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(67.02,153.65)}funnynaoto\NGordingus\NPollychan\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.69,0:01:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No regrets, every tear that we pride\Nonly helps our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}Funimation\NPamkinPinguin\Nspicyapples
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.93,0:01:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.49,0:01:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.11,0:01:55.53,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H181818&\3c&H181818&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(729,0)\t(687,729,\1a&H00&)}I Made It Here{11:16 / 12:22}
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.11,0:01:55.53,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(729,0)}I Made It Here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.29,0:02:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The long battle that divided Skypiea\Nfor 400 years has finally ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.27,0:02:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where there once was war, there\Nis now a joyous celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.09,0:02:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.77,0:02:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't drink anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.37,0:02:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.55,0:02:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.73,0:02:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go wake everyone up, quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.12,0:02:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause we're gonna steal the golden run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.29,0:02:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's gold? Where? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet, loudmouth! Loudmouth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.61,0:02:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a whole lot louder than me, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.72,0:02:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just listen to yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.64,0:02:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what you are, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loud! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.73,0:02:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're calling me loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.03,0:02:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve, you hypocrite!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.21,0:02:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're super loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.23,0:02:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:02:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're super Mock ultra loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.75,0:02:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you're yelling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.97,0:03:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason I'm yelling is so you\Ncan hear me over your head so loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.73,0:03:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to sleep over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop playing with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a lady, and ladies don't just yell\Nwith their mouths wide open now, do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I do something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have turned out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.25,0:03:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have me, because it's in between!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're looking good this morning,\Nbut I mean, it's evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, those blue sea people sure\Ndo like to party, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.13,0:03:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After four days of this, you'd\Nthink they'd be worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.69,0:03:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way they could be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.25,0:03:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then that's the plan, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.27,0:03:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's right, gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not every day we get to\Ngo to an island in the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so let's make this trip worthwhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.17,0:03:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief, we found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.51,0:03:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have just found the Golden Bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.33,0:03:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's hanging off Giant Jack,\Nbut I don't know for how long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're trying to pull it up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.75,0:04:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need every able-bodied\Nwarrior at the western shore now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.03,0:04:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.03,0:04:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Gather the tribe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.67,0:04:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Belfry's been found! Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.41,0:04:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way! Come on! Right!\NAre you sure? Yes, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.01,0:04:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They found the golden bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.33,0:04:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes. Hurry up! I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on the western shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They found the belfry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.89,0:04:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to the western shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The belfry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still need more people!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.89,0:05:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the pride of Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.69,0:05:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.23,0:05:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it everything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call this a rubber band?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.09,0:05:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and here's a little\Ninside information about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.75,0:06:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those babies are the primary\Nthing that took down Giant Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.09,0:06:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm the only one in\Nthe world who has them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.19,0:06:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.65,0:06:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, there's more, namely...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This piece of metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.21,0:06:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gather round, folks, and take a gander.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.49,0:06:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no ordinary\Npiece of metal, no Saru.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It came for our valiant\Nvessel, the Go and Merry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.47,0:06:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's withstood the Grand Line and\NInaru's attacks with barely a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.35,0:06:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This here's the king of metal sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just think, it can all\Nbe yours. How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to trade some of your dolls for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not really, but I'll gladly trade you\Nfor this rubber band. So will I. Got more?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.39,0:06:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want three.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:07:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.83,0:07:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure are in a good mood, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.69,0:07:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm assuming your trading went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.73,0:07:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, and Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.01,0:07:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at all the dials I got!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One little press.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.19,0:07:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.89,0:07:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.49,0:07:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do so many things with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old Lusop workshops are going\Nto be totally revolutionized!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.49,0:07:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could use one to store\Nsmells in your sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way you'd smell fresh-cut\Nmelons every time you practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.13,0:07:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound good? No, thanks. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of weapons, I'm going to use\Nthese to make Nami's climb attack stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.57,0:07:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention my slingshot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, where's everybody else, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others are still inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin went off by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.63,0:08:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snake's still conked out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.19,0:08:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be really tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.37,0:08:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd be too if he danced\Nfor four days straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.25,0:08:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what he was so happy about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.51,0:08:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I hope they come out soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.23,0:08:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he wakes up, I don't\Nknow how friendly he'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who this well-mannered snake easy for you\Nto say you didn't see him when he was mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.81,0:08:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said you didn't\Nsee him just wait till he
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.97,0:08:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tries to eat you you'll\Nsee what a pain he can be
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.91,0:08:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fooled you with the tone dial?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.33,0:08:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop being so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.49,0:08:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me stupid, but you're\Nthe one who got fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought Luffy ate too\Nmuch. Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.39,0:08:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, I told ya Wow, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.77,0:08:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.17,0:08:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a bell, just like the\Nones the big monkeys showed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.49,0:09:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, see, see, there's so much stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.83,0:09:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's all ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.59,0:09:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.17,0:09:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect it to be so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.97,0:09:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.19,0:09:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but... Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the side columns\Nis broken off. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.39,0:09:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shame! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.55,0:09:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.77,0:09:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under the bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poneglyph!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.41,0:09:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's the stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our ancestors gave their lives to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.77,0:09:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief, the words that are\Ninscribed on it, what do they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an ancient text.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.11,0:09:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.65,0:09:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall know the true meaning\Nand utter it to no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our legacy to be the\Ninheritors of history,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.07,0:10:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and our duty to protect it with\Nthe sounding of the Grand Belfry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.25,0:10:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those words, how do you know them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.67,0:10:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were inscribed on a wall\Nin the ruins of Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generations ago, your people were\Nentrusted to be its guardians, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.80,0:10:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can actually read\Nthose ancient characters?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It mentions Poseidon, an ancient\Nweapon named after a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It even gives its whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.69,0:10:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ancient weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.25,0:10:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why would it say something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.03,0:10:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One different from Pluton of Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to think there are dangerous things\Nlike this out there in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all just waiting to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just another dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't what I was looking\Nfor, what I wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.51,0:11:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey miss, is that stuff engraved on\Nthe side part of the pony glyph too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.03,0:11:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold. D. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.71,0:11:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.69,0:11:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.19,0:11:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I will guide this passage all the\Nway to the farthest ends of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.63,0:11:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stormiest seas will not\Nstop me, Pirate Gold Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Pirate King?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then this could only mean that\Nhe came to the Sky Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.37,0:11:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And more importantly, how was he able to\Nunderstand and use this ancient language?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.69,0:11:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it says Roger, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.21,0:11:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.35,0:11:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A blue sea pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I met him when he came to\Nthis land over 20 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it that his name\Nis inscribed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.15,0:11:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:12:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I have no idea how he managed\Nto reach this bell, but somehow he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.41,0:12:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this inscription is\Nproof that he was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.33,0:12:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, there\Nare two kinds of poneglyph stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.31,0:12:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ones that contain information,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.31,0:12:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and others that tell how to reach other\Nponeglyphs scattered throughout the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.15,0:12:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stone obviously has information.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.27,0:12:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it here,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.65,0:12:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I will guide this passage all the\Nway to the farthest ends of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.21,0:12:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guide this passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.01,0:12:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guide
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could he? Could he mean the Rio Poneglyph?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.13,0:12:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This Poneglyph Its duty\Nhas been fulfilled Its duty
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:12:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.51,0:12:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a hunch about these Poneglyphs As I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.95,0:13:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,said there were certain\Nones spread across the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world that contain\Ninformation by reading them
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.35,0:13:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as one i believe they'll\Nform a passage that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will reveal the true history of the blank
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,century in other words\Nthe passage completed by
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.07,0:13:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,connecting them is what\Nwill make up a legendary
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,final poneglyph that's\Nyet to be discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.51,0:13:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the real poneglyph gold d roger must\Nhave taken the text from the poneglyph
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here to the island where the rio\Nponeglyph may very well be located
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have done that. Does that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mean we don't have to fight any longer
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then our ancestors wish has been fulfilled
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.93,0:13:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chief hang on are you all right
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thank goodness our war is finally over
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.31,0:14:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I better get to fulfilling my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like Roger before me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.81,0:14:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to guide this\Npassage and the other ones
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've read all the way to\Nthe end of the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.97,0:14:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the island of Raftel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.65,0:14:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.89,0:14:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.13,0:14:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was about to tell you how much your\Nfriend in the Straw Hat reminds me of Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.53,0:14:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boy is interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name's Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, and I find him\Ninteresting as well. D.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the lad even shares the\Nsame middle initial as Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I'm sure there's got to be\Nsome historical significance to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, miss,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.81,0:14:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I recall you and your friend\Nsaying that you sought gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.21,0:14:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and didn't you say it was more valuable\Nthan Firth on the Blue Sea? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.55,0:14:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We obviously can't offer you the belfry,\Nbut how about the broken support?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.37,0:15:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.77,0:15:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to give something to our heroes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.55,0:15:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's a perfect\Ntoken of our appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please take it. We insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.23,0:15:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.75,0:15:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's bring this gift to our\Nfriends from the Blue Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.93,0:15:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we wrap it up, it'll\Nbe easier to carry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.97,0:15:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna take every\None of us to move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.87,0:15:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.05,0:15:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.87,0:15:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.47,0:15:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a soul in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.59,0:15:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to admit, this is pretty weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.49,0:15:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonder where all those angels\Nand warriors ran off to and why.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.41,0:15:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, be thankful they're gone. Trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if they see us making a\Nrun for it with all the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,loot we pulled from their\Nfavorite giant snake,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.87,0:15:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they're not gonna be too thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.69,0:15:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami and Conis probably already\Nhave the ship ready to sell by now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.85,0:16:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so Robin better hurry\Nand get back here quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got anything to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, all the food's on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta have the whole\Nthing to munch on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of just sitting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys can wait for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.48,0:16:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid head!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.20,0:16:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell the guys they're all like\Nstupid before you have to go back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.49,0:16:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! It's Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.65,0:16:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, hot stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.95,0:16:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stole some gold! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.51,0:16:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right behind her, see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can hear you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! It's an army!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no! Not good! Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.31,0:16:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That big thing can only\Nbe one thing! A cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.07,0:16:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.85,0:17:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just our luck, they'd\Nall come back at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.15,0:17:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the lid out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.51,0:17:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get back to the ship now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out this ghoul!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.59,0:17:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet we found every\Npiece on the island, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.47,0:17:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From here, it looks like they've\Nalready packed their bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not leaving already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on you guys don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh great. Here they come
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.49,0:17:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's up to\Nme to handle this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say like hell will stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.11,0:17:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wish life and limb to come\Nto this island in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.29,0:17:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capture them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.20,0:17:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.15,0:17:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing we're\Ntrying to do is thank them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.43,0:17:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Miss, is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.31,0:17:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your friends\Nwant this gold, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we don't. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.93,0:18:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know they're chasing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.51,0:18:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, did you see me take\Ncare of him back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.23,0:18:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.67,0:18:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.37,0:18:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robin! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.01,0:18:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.87,0:18:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until we reach Cloudy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.59,0:18:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're lost and alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.39,0:18:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can always hear your voice\Nwhile you wander far from home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.79,0:18:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gazing up at the sky, you\Nare just like the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.11,0:19:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never change as you\Nclimb into the night!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your reflection waves when
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you disappear fading so silently?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay as you are, don't lose your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.47,0:19:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let these words guide you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't ever look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.63,0:19:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on your\Ndreams. Their endless nights!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They come to you again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.37,0:19:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until you see the journey through?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not turn, I hope that you learn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.97,0:19:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put your past behind,\Nand just keep moving on.

